Subject: [PATCH] AI-KNOWLEDGE.md: the agent's working knowledge, kept current

A new docs/AI-KNOWLEDGE.md holds what another AI needs to act like the
agent that has run this project: the product, the people and how to work
with them, the release rules that bite, the recording rules, the state on
staging and production, the positions taken and why, the traps hit, and a
short verification recipe. The owner asked for it to grow with every
request; records.test.ts now fails when its 'Covers up to J###' is behind
the journal. CLAUDE.md, HANDOFF.md and FOR-AI-AGENT.md point to it first,
and the knowledge-base export includes it.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Je1v64McNyB6XEu6gFgM4C
